    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108405" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόθεμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόθημα</span>
			, <i>base,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				53.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				57.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				97.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				143.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1011d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ὑποθέματι ἀγρῷ</span>
			<i>on the security</i> of land, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				672.25
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2048
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Philippopolis</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ὑποθέμασιν ἀξιοχρέοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Cos</u>
					383.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				976.48
			</span></i> (Samos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθέματα</span> (corrected to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθήκας</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> λαβεῖν τῶν τε οἰκιῶν καὶ κτημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					640.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω τῶν μωστίων ὑπόθεμα δραχμὰς τ́</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1523.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
